{"id":"u30","kelas":10,"no":4,"judul":"Teks Prosedur","title":"Procedure Text","emoji":"🧾","ringkas":"Instruksi langkah demi langkah dan kalimat perintah","ready":true,"goals":["memahami struktur **procedure text**: **Goal**, **Materials**, dan **Steps**","memakai **kalimat perintah** (imperative) positif dan negatif untuk memberi instruksi","memakai kata urutan: [[first]], [[next]], [[then]], [[after that]], [[finally]]","memakai ungkapan peringatan: [[Make sure ...]], [[Be careful ...]], [[Don't ...]]","menjelaskan tujuan dan batas waktu dengan [[to + kata kerja]], [[until]], dan [[so that]]","membaca dan menulis petunjuk membuat, memakai, atau melakukan sesuatu"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Resep masakan, cara memakai mesin fotokopi, cara mendaftar akun online. Semuanya adalah **procedure text**, yaitu teks yang menjelaskan **bagaimana cara** membuat atau melakukan sesuatu melalui **langkah-langkah** yang berurutan. Di kelas 8 kamu sudah mengenal dasarnya. Sekarang kamu belajar menyusunnya dengan rapi dan lengkap."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur procedure text","table":[["Bagian","Isi","Contoh"],["**Goal**","Tujuan atau judul: apa yang akan dibuat atau dilakukan","[[How to Make Scrambled Eggs]]"],["**Materials**","Bahan atau alat yang dibutuhkan","[[2 eggs, a pinch of salt, 1 tablespoon of oil]]"],["**Steps**","Langkah-langkah berurutan","[[First, crack the eggs into a bowl. Next, add the salt ...]]"],["Tips (opsional)","Saran atau peringatan tambahan","[[Be careful. The pan is hot.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Ciri kebahasaan","table":[["Ciri","Contoh"],["**Kalimat perintah** (kata kerja dasar di awal)","[[Mix the flour and the sugar.]]"],["**Kata urutan**","[[First]], [[Next]], [[Then]], [[After that]], [[Finally]]"],["**Keterangan cara** (adverb of manner)","[[Stir slowly.]] / [[Cut the onion carefully.]]"],["**Takaran dan jumlah** yang jelas","[[two cups of water]], [[a teaspoon of salt]]"],["**Simple present** untuk fakta umum","[[The water boils at 100 degrees Celsius.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kata kerja yang sering dipakai","items":[{"en":"mix","id":"mencampur","ex":"Mix the flour and the eggs."},{"en":"stir","id":"mengaduk","ex":"Stir the soup slowly."},{"en":"slice","id":"mengiris","ex":"Slice the tomato."},{"en":"pour","id":"menuangkan","ex":"Pour the water into the glass."},{"en":"boil","id":"merebus / mendidih","ex":"Boil the eggs for ten minutes."},{"en":"fry","id":"menggoreng","ex":"Fry the rice for five minutes."},{"en":"press","id":"menekan","ex":"Press the green button."},{"en":"plug in","id":"menancapkan kabel listrik","ex":"Plug in the cable."},{"en":"turn on","id":"menyalakan","ex":"Turn on the computer."},{"en":"turn off","id":"mematikan","ex":"Turn off the stove."},{"en":"insert","id":"memasukkan","ex":"Insert your card."},{"en":"click","id":"mengeklik","ex":"Click the link."},{"en":"select","id":"memilih","ex":"Select your language."},{"en":"wait","id":"menunggu","ex":"Wait for a few minutes."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Kalimat perintah","text":"Kalimat perintah memakai **kata kerja bentuk dasar** tanpa subjek. Untuk larangan, tambahkan **Don't**. Untuk lebih sopan, tambahkan **please**.","table":[["Jenis","Pola","Contoh"],["Perintah","kata kerja dasar + ...","[[Open the lid.]]"],["Larangan","**Don't** + kata kerja dasar","[[Don't touch the hot pan.]]"],["Sopan","**Please** + kata kerja dasar","[[Please wait here.]]"],["Peringatan","[[Make sure]] / [[Be careful]] + ...","[[Make sure the machine is off.]] / [[Be careful not to spill the water.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Jangan pakai subjek atau -ing","text":"Benar: [[Add the salt.]] Salah: *You adding the salt.* dan *Adds the salt.* Pakai kata kerja **bentuk dasar**."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Tujuan dan batas waktu","table":[["Kata","Fungsi","Contoh"],["[[to + kata kerja]]","menyatakan tujuan","[[Use a knife to slice the onion.]]"],["[[so that]]","supaya","[[Stir the soup so that it doesn't burn.]]"],["[[until]]","sampai","[[Stir until the sugar dissolves.]]"],["[[for + waktu]]","lamanya","[[Boil the noodles for three minutes.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: How to Make Scrambled Eggs","lines":[{"who":"Goal","en":"How to Make Scrambled Eggs","id":"Cara Membuat Telur Orak-arik"},{"who":"Materials","en":"You need two eggs, a pinch of salt, one tablespoon of oil, and a little pepper.","id":"Kamu membutuhkan dua butir telur, sejumput garam, satu sendok makan minyak, dan sedikit merica."},{"who":"Steps","en":"First, crack the eggs into a bowl. Next, add the salt and the pepper, then beat the eggs with a fork.","id":"Pertama, pecahkan telur ke dalam mangkuk. Selanjutnya, tambahkan garam dan merica, lalu kocok telur dengan garpu."},{"who":"Steps","en":"Then heat the oil in a pan over low heat. Pour the eggs into the pan and stir slowly until they are soft and yellow.","id":"Lalu panaskan minyak di wajan dengan api kecil. Tuangkan telur ke wajan dan aduk perlahan sampai lembut dan kuning."},{"who":"Steps","en":"Finally, put the eggs on a plate and serve them hot. Be careful. The pan is hot.","id":"Terakhir, taruh telur di piring dan sajikan selagi hangat. Hati-hati, wajannya panas."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 2: How to Join an Online Class","lines":[{"who":"Goal","en":"How to Join an Online Class","id":"Cara Mengikuti Kelas Online"},{"who":"Materials","en":"You need a laptop or a phone, a stable internet connection, and the class link.","id":"Kamu membutuhkan laptop atau ponsel, koneksi internet yang stabil, dan tautan kelas."},{"who":"Steps","en":"First, open the link from your teacher. Second, type your full name and click the Join button.","id":"Pertama, buka tautan dari gurumu. Kedua, ketik nama lengkapmu dan klik tombol Join."},{"who":"Steps","en":"Next, allow the app to use your microphone and your camera. Make sure your microphone is off until the teacher asks you to speak.","id":"Selanjutnya, izinkan aplikasi memakai mikrofon dan kameramu. Pastikan mikrofonmu mati sampai guru memintamu berbicara."},{"who":"Steps","en":"Finally, wait for the class to begin. Don't forget to turn off your microphone when you finish speaking.","id":"Terakhir, tunggu sampai kelas dimulai. Jangan lupa mematikan mikrofon setelah selesai berbicara."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Meminta petunjuk","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Dina, how do I use the photocopy machine? I have never used it.","id":"Dina, bagaimana cara memakai mesin fotokopi? Aku belum pernah memakainya."},{"who":"Dina","en":"It's easy. First, lift the cover and put your paper face down on the glass.","id":"Mudah. Pertama, angkat penutup dan taruh kertasmu menghadap ke bawah di atas kaca."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Then what should I do?","id":"Lalu apa yang harus kulakukan?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Close the cover, choose the number of copies, and press the green button. Don't open the cover while the machine is working.","id":"Tutup penutupnya, pilih jumlah salinan, dan tekan tombol hijau. Jangan buka penutup saat mesin bekerja."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Menulis langkah yang baik","text":"Satu langkah, satu kegiatan. Pakai kata urutan, takaran yang jelas, dan peringatan penting. Setelah menulis, **baca ulang** dan bayangkan orang lain mengikutinya: apakah ada langkah yang terlewat?"},{"t":"summary","items":["Struktur: **Goal → Materials → Steps** (+ tips).","Langkah memakai **kalimat perintah**: [[Mix ...]], [[Add ...]]; larangan: [[Don't ...]].","Kata urutan: [[first]], [[next]], [[then]], [[after that]], [[finally]].","Peringatan: [[Make sure ...]], [[Be careful ...]].","Tujuan dan batas waktu: [[to + V]], [[so that]], [[until]], [[for + waktu]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kerja dengan artinya:","pairs":[["mix","mencampur"],["pour","menuangkan"],["slice","mengiris"],["stir","mengaduk"],["boil","merebus"]],"exp":"Kata kerja yang sering muncul dalam resep.","k":"ba49ea07"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kerja dengan artinya:","pairs":[["turn on","menyalakan"],["turn off","mematikan"],["insert","memasukkan"],["press","menekan"]],"exp":"Kata kerja untuk mengoperasikan alat.","k":"c01c3532"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian procedure text yang berisi bahan atau alat adalah...","options":["Goal","Materials","Steps","Re-orientation"],"answer":1,"exp":"Materials berisi bahan dan alat.","k":"ecc1fcdc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian procedure text yang berisi langkah berurutan adalah...","options":["Goal","Materials","Steps","Orientation"],"answer":2,"exp":"Steps = langkah-langkah.","k":"c3879c55"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang merupakan kalimat perintah?","options":["She opens the door.","Open the door.","He is opening the door.","They opened the door."],"answer":1,"exp":"Kalimat perintah dimulai dengan kata kerja dasar.","k":"2c94ce6c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat larangan yang benar adalah...","options":["Not touch the pan.","Don't touch the pan.","Don't touching the pan.","Doesn't touch the pan."],"answer":1,"exp":"Don't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"81e9dcd9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"Stir the soup ___ it doesn't burn.\"","options":["so that","because of","but","although"],"answer":0,"exp":"so that = supaya.","k":"220d57e9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"Stir ___ the sugar dissolves.\"","options":["until","while","or","than"],"answer":0,"exp":"until = sampai.","k":"5c8bac39"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tuangkan air ke dalam gelas.","q":"___ the water into the glass. (pour)","answers":["Pour"],"hint":"kata kerja dasar","exp":"Kalimat perintah dimulai dengan kata kerja dasar.","k":"91299b37"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jangan sentuh wajan yang panas.","q":"___ touch the hot pan.","answers":["Don't","Do not"],"hint":"larangan","exp":"Don't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"356aad4f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pastikan mesin dalam keadaan mati.","q":"___ sure the machine is off.","answers":["Make"],"hint":"Make / Be ?","exp":"Make sure = pastikan.","k":"bb4c7148"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rebus telur selama sepuluh menit.","q":"Boil the eggs ___ ten minutes.","answers":["for"],"hint":"waktu lamanya","exp":"for + lama waktu.","k":"2f8c658f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pakai pisau untuk mengiris bawang.","q":"Use a knife ___ slice the onion.","answers":["to"],"hint":"tujuan","exp":"to + kata kerja menyatakan tujuan.","k":"b87c2a6c"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Pertama, pecahkan telur ke dalam mangkuk.\"","answer":"First, crack the eggs into a bowl.","exp":"First, + kalimat perintah.","k":"f09bfcdb"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Jangan buka penutup saat mesin bekerja.\"","answer":"Don't open the cover while the machine is working.","exp":"Don't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"b006682a"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tekan tombol hijau.\"","answer":"Press the green button.","exp":"Kata kerja dasar + objek.","k":"45a99bdd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar dalam procedure text?","options":["You adding the salt.","Add the salt.","Adds the salt.","Added the salt."],"answer":1,"exp":"Langkah memakai kalimat perintah.","k":"c8c369bc"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Make sure the machine is off","options":["Pastikan mesin dalam keadaan mati","Nyalakan mesinnya","Perbaiki mesinnya","Jual mesinnya"],"answer":0,"exp":"Make sure = pastikan.","k":"5b81e140"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Stir slowly until the sugar dissolves","options":["Aduk perlahan sampai gulanya larut","Tambahkan gula sedikit","Panaskan gula","Jangan aduk gulanya"],"answer":0,"exp":"until = sampai; dissolves = larut.","k":"a627bb55"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Don't open the cover while the machine is working","options":["Jangan buka penutup saat mesin bekerja","Buka penutup sebelum mesin bekerja","Tutup penutup setelah mesin bekerja","Mesin tidak punya penutup"],"answer":0,"exp":"Don't = jangan.","k":"3d4bcc31"},{"type":"fill","id":"Panaskan minyak di wajan.","q":"___ the oil in a pan. (heat)","answers":["Heat"],"hint":"kata kerja dasar","exp":"Kalimat perintah: Heat.","k":"037188e8"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kocok telur dengan garpu.","q":"___ the eggs with a fork. (beat)","answers":["Beat"],"hint":"kata kerja dasar","exp":"Beat = mengocok.","k":"7daa65dd"},{"type":"fill","id":"Klik tombol Join.","q":"___ the Join button. (click)","answers":["Click"],"hint":"kata kerja dasar","exp":"Click = mengeklik.","k":"80eeca7c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pilih bahasamu.","q":"___ your language. (select)","answers":["Select"],"hint":"kata kerja dasar","exp":"Select = memilih.","k":"3bea4a91"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tancapkan kabelnya.","q":"___ the cable. (plug in)","answers":["Plug in"],"hint":"plug in","exp":"Plug in = menancapkan kabel.","k":"81d30a45"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jangan lupa matikan lampu.","q":"___ forget to turn off the light.","answers":["Don't","Do not"],"hint":"larangan","exp":"Don't forget = jangan lupa.","k":"e9f70045"},{"type":"fill","id":"Hati-hati, airnya panas.","q":"___ careful. The water is hot.","answers":["Be"],"hint":"Be / Make ?","exp":"Be careful = hati-hati.","k":"bdde3dec"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aduk sampai adonan halus.","q":"Stir ___ the mixture is smooth.","answers":["until"],"hint":"sampai","exp":"until = sampai.","k":"f9b4fe9d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Gunakan sendok untuk mengaduk kopi.","q":"Use a spoon ___ stir the coffee.","answers":["to"],"hint":"tujuan","exp":"to + kata kerja = untuk.","k":"041d2916"},{"type":"fill","id":"Potong bawang dengan hati-hati.","q":"Cut the onion ___. (careful)","answers":["carefully"],"hint":"careful + ly","exp":"Keterangan cara: carefully.","k":"74f5033d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih langkah yang ditulis dengan benar.","options":["You must to open the lid.","Open the lid.","Opening the lid.","Opens the lid."],"answer":1,"exp":"Langkah memakai kalimat perintah.","k":"bd33fb07"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang berisi peringatan?","options":["Pour the water into the pot.","Be careful. The oil is very hot.","First, wash the rice.","Add a pinch of salt."],"answer":1,"exp":"Be careful menyatakan peringatan.","k":"6d0d7228"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata urutan mana yang BUKAN untuk memulai langkah?","options":["First","Next","Finally","To begin with"],"answer":2,"exp":"Finally dipakai untuk langkah terakhir.","k":"e95d1ca9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Stir the soup so that it doesn't burn.\" Kata \"so that\" menyatakan...","options":["tujuan (supaya)","lawan","waktu","tempat"],"answer":0,"exp":"so that = supaya.","k":"df42a197"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bahan yang disebut sebelum langkah-langkah ditulis di bagian...","options":["Goal","Materials","Steps","Tips"],"answer":1,"exp":"Materials berisi bahan dan alat.","k":"8a2383a9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Judul yang cocok untuk procedure text adalah...","options":["How to Make Fried Rice","My Holiday in Bali","The Life of a Frog","A Beautiful Beach"],"answer":0,"exp":"Procedure text diawali How to ...","k":"98ba3389"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat larangan yang benar.","options":["Don't to run in the laboratory.","Don't run in the laboratory.","Not run in the laboratory.","Don't running in the laboratory."],"answer":1,"exp":"Don't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"48a11a79"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang lebih sopan?","options":["Sit down.","Please sit down.","You sit down now.","Sit down quickly."],"answer":1,"exp":"Tambahkan please.","k":"a7a1fa44"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang merupakan tips?","options":["Take two eggs.","Make sure the eggs are fresh.","Crack the eggs.","Put the eggs in a bowl."],"answer":1,"exp":"Make sure ... biasa dipakai untuk saran atau peringatan.","k":"2e565810"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Panaskan minyak di atas api kecil.\"","answer":"Heat the oil over low heat.","exp":"Heat + objek + keterangan.","k":"91569d6f"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tunggu beberapa menit.\"","answer":"Wait for a few minutes.","exp":"Wait for + lama waktu.","k":"54b96e60"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Setelah itu, tambahkan garam.\"","answer":"After that, add the salt.","exp":"After that, + kalimat perintah.","k":"e744db5d"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Jangan lupa mematikan mikrofon.\"","answer":"Don't forget to turn off your microphone.","exp":"Don't forget to + kata kerja dasar.","k":"e489badf"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kerja dengan artinya:","pairs":[["fry","menggoreng"],["wait","menunggu"],["click","mengeklik"],["select","memilih"]],"exp":"Kata kerja untuk resep dan petunjuk alat.","k":"d87157e8"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian dengan isinya:","pairs":[["Goal","tujuan atau judul"],["Materials","bahan dan alat"],["Steps","langkah-langkah"],["Tips","saran tambahan"]],"exp":"Setiap bagian punya fungsi.","k":"76a5b721"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"First crack the eggs into a bowl","options":["Pertama, pecahkan telur ke dalam mangkuk","Pertama, beli telur di pasar","Terakhir, makan telurnya","Jangan pecahkan telurnya"],"answer":0,"exp":"crack = memecahkan.","k":"6cd9a9a4"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Please wait here","options":["Tolong tunggu di sini","Tolong pergi dari sini","Tolong duduk di sana","Tolong masuk"],"answer":0,"exp":"please = tolong.","k":"4ad4b57a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Press the green button to start","options":["Tekan tombol hijau untuk memulai","Tekan tombol merah untuk berhenti","Putar tombol hijau","Jangan tekan tombol apa pun"],"answer":0,"exp":"to start = untuk memulai.","k":"a02f85a1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Panaskan minyak di wajan.","q":"___ the oil in the pan.","answers":["Heat"],"hint":"memanaskan","exp":"Kalimat perintah memakai kata kerja dasar.","k":"74e28f82"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tuangkan air ke dalam gelas.","q":"___ the water into the glass.","answers":["Pour"],"hint":"menuangkan","exp":"pour = menuangkan.","k":"0cbf67dd"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aduk campuran itu perlahan.","q":"Stir the mixture ___.","answers":["slowly"],"hint":"perlahan","exp":"slowly = perlahan.","k":"9c566762"},{"type":"fill","id":